  "description": "Client-only ITransport over System.Net.WebSockets.ClientWebSocket for the FS.GG.Net component — the StarCraft II substrate. Reassembles protocol-level continuation frames into complete application messages, pools receive buffers, and retries the initial connect (the SC2 game boots its process, then listens on ws://127.0.0.1:PORT/sc2api). No server host in v1 (both first uses are clients). ADR-0052.",
